<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>纽约时报 实时热点</title><link>https://rss.nytimes.com/services/xml/rss/nyt/HomePage.xml</link><description>纽约时报 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:40:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>由于美国收紧对中国的限制，英伟达停止向东南亚销售</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/business/nvidia-southeast-asia-sales.html</link><description>四个国家的运输暂停是在美国一项新规定之后进行的，该规定要求这些国家的公司购买先进的人工智能需要获得许可。筹码。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/business/nvidia-southeast-asia-sales.html'&gt;由于美国收紧对中国的限制，英伟达停止向东南亚销售&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nvidia Halts Sales to Southeast Asia as U.S. Tightens China Restrictions&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/business/nvidia-southeast-asia-sales.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:04:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>特朗普对市场上英伟达的飙升感到高兴。它并没有持续多久。</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/trump-nvidia-stock-market.html</link><description>最近几天股市的回落表明，特朗普总统推动重新任命公司首席执行官的努力与他其他政策的现实发生了冲突。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/trump-nvidia-stock-market.html'&gt;特朗普对市场上英伟达的飙升感到高兴。它并没有持续多久。&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump Rejoiced in the Market’s Nvidia Surge. It Didn’t Last Long.&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/trump-nvidia-stock-market.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:53:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>有证据表明，陆军很早就知道爱荷华州的爆炸风险</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-lead-ammunition-stockpile-history.html</link><description>爱荷华州一家工厂的不稳定爆炸物清除工作一年多前就开始了，但当时尚未完成，为周三有争议的爆炸埋下了伏笔。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-lead-ammunition-stockpile-history.html'&gt;有证据表明，陆军很早就知道爱荷华州的爆炸风险&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：The Army Knew Much Earlier of the Explosive Risk in Iowa, Evidence Suggests&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/iowa-lead-ammunition-stockpile-history.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:00:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>周六感恩节游行。他们能做到吗？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/thanksgiving-parade-new-york-postponed.html</link><description>经过一个多世纪的传统后，梅西百货感恩节游行突然变得灵活起来。当然，这很好。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/thanksgiving-parade-new-york-postponed.html'&gt;周六感恩节游行。他们能做到吗？&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：The Thanksgiving Parade Is on a Saturday. Can They Do That?&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/thanksgiving-parade-new-york-postponed.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 14:07:50 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>纽约感恩节游行气球泄气</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/nyregion/macys-parade-balloons-thanksgiving.html</link><description>梅西百货感恩节游行因强风暴而推迟后，工作人员通宵工作，在恶劣天气到来之前给气球放气。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/nyregion/macys-parade-balloons-thanksgiving.html'&gt;纽约感恩节游行气球泄气&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Thanksgiving Parade Balloons Are Deflated in New York&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/nyregion/macys-parade-balloons-thanksgiving.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 14:06:46 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>